{"unit_id":"sprainJinyu__dsh-vision-link#card-zh","repo":"sprainJinyu/dsh-vision-link","commit":"6b8297c74b3b21a56b813407d6deb933f1889347","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-link 是面向 DSH Web 的视觉旁路插件：它让已选中的文本模型继续负责推理和回答，并把消息中的图片交由配置的多模态模型提取文字、布局、数字、状态和图表等视觉证据，再将图片内容替换为文本证据后交回原模型路由。用户可粘贴或拖入图片，按文本模型配置视觉映射与 OCR、界面、图表、代码等关注重点；设置页可管理映射或生成 YAML。适合在不切换主模型的情况下分析截图、界面、代码报错和图表。需要在 DSH 配置可处理图片的模型及映射。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:183-232","src/index.js:600-727","client.js:895-941"]}
{"unit_id":"sprainJinyu__dsh-vision-link#card-en","repo":"sprainJinyu/dsh-vision-link","commit":"6b8297c74b3b21a56b813407d6deb933f1889347","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-vision-link lets DSH Web text models answer image questions while keeping the selected route. A mapped vision model turns images into text evidence, then the original model answers. Paste or drop images and choose OCR, UI, chart, or code focus. Configure an image model and mapping.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:183-232","src/index.js:600-727","client.js:895-941"]}
